{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52176","headline":"颂六十二首 一 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"騄骥资鞭策，兰蕙伫薰风。\n至理信难见，非人孰可通。\n输心仰圆寂，莹晒入玄中。\n总辔超三有，抟飞上四空。\n簪缨犹忽梦，财利若尘蒙。\n高揖谢时俗，萧洒出烦笼。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第五四册道世《诸经要集》卷二《三宝部》）（按：《古今禅藻集》卷一收此首爲隋无名释作，题作《顺益颂》，实误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}